eeker and ruler of the [[Amazons]]. Before she died, she gave her daughter the [[Ring]] of [[Behemoth]], the Legendary Titan of Body. {{source|Ladies' Choice}}\n\nMany years later, her possessions would be recovered by [[Dante Vale]] and his team and give a bedridden Metz will power to spare. {{source|Ladies' Choice}}\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Amazons]]\n[[Category:Deceased characters]]","text":"Many years ago when her life was once in danger, she was saved by a Seeker named Metz. Metz took her to the outside world and eventually married her in the Cathedral of Notre Dame. She never told anyone else about this event. At some point, she bore a child named Hippolyta, who became a Seeker and ruler of the Amazons. Before she died, she gave her daughter the Ring of Behemoth, the Legendary Titan of Body. [Ladies' Choice]\n\nMany years later, her possessions would be recovered by Dante Vale and his team and give a bedridden Metz will power to spare. [Ladies' Choice]"}],"full_text":"Hippolyta's mother was an Amazon queen and the wife of Metz. Her status as a Seeker is currently unknown. \n\n== History ==\nMany years ago when her life was once in danger, she was saved by a Seeker named Metz. Metz took her to the outside world and eventually married her in the Cathedral of Notre Dame. She never told anyone else about this event. At some point, she bore a child named Hippolyta, who became a Seeker and ruler of the Amazons. Before she died, she gave her daughter the Ring of Behemoth, the Legendary Titan of Body. [Ladies' Choice]\n\nMany years later, her possessions would be recovered by Dante Vale and his team and give a bedridden Metz will power to spare. [Ladies' Choice]","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image            = File:S1E19_Metz_wedding_photo.jpg\n| husband          = [[Metz]] \n| children         = [[Hippolyta]]\n| residence        = \n| group            = [[Amazons]]\n| first appearance = \"[[Ladies' Choice]]\" (mentioned)\n| last appearance  = \n| gender           = Female\n| hair color       = \n| eye color        = \n| voice actor      = \n| see also         = \n}}'''Hippolyta's mother''' was an [[Amazons|Amazon]] queen and the wife of [[Metz]]. Her status as a [[Seeker]] is currently unknown. \n\n== History ==\nMany years ago when her life was once in danger, she was saved by a [[Seeker]] named [[Metz]]. Metz took her to the outside world and eventually married her in the [[Cathedral of Notre Dame]]. She never told anyone else about this event. At some point, she bore a child named [[Hippolyta]], who became a Seeker and ruler of the [[Amazons]]. Before she died, she gave her daughter the [[Ring]] of [[Behemoth]], the Legendary Titan of Body. {{source|Ladies' Choice}}\n\nMany years later, her possessions would be recovered by [[Dante Vale]] and his team and give a bedridden Metz will power to spare. {{source|Ladies' Choice}}\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Amazons]]\n[[Category:Deceased characters]]","categories":["Amazons","Characters","Deceased characters"],"links":[{"target_title":"Metz","label":"Metz","target_id":"huntik:page:3213","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Metz","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3213"},{"target_title":"Hippolyta","label":"Hippolyta","target_id":"huntik:page:3497","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Hippolyta","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3497"},{"target_title":"Amazons","label":"Amazons","target_id":"huntik:page:5617","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Amazons","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5617"},{"target_title":"Ladies' Choice","label":"Ladies' Choice","target_id":"huntik:page:3572","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Ladies%27_Choice","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3572"},{"target_title":"Amazons","label":"Amazon","target_id":"huntik:page:5617","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Amazons","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%